{"id":"au_n","lemma":"aún","pos":"adv","rank":166,"glosses":["still, yet","even (implying an extreme example in the case mentioned)"],"ipa":"/aˈun/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d3/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-a%C3%BAn.wav","examples":[{"text":"Él aún sigue vivo.","en":"He's still alive.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/444358"},{"text":"Aún no lo sabe.","en":"I don't know yet.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/688336"},{"text":"Él aún está enojado.","en":"He is still angry.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/443346"},{"text":"Aún no estoy listo.","en":"I'm not ready yet.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/444179"},{"text":"Aún no se termina.","en":"It isn't over yet.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/444463"}]}